@* The standalone Graph page (a fixed intake-pipeline topology diagram) was retired in the redesign:
   a topology that need not match any real workflow had little value. The Workflow Builder now shows
   the loaded workflow's own graph. This keeps the old /graph route alive by redirecting to the
   Builder so existing bookmarks/links never hit a 404 (FR-009). *@
@page "/graph"
@inject NavigationManager Nav

@code {
    /// <summary>Redirect to the Workflow Builder as soon as the component initialises.</summary>
    protected override void OnInitialized() => Nav.NavigateTo("/workflow-builder", replace: true);
}
